"Celena North's MagiPhys obstacle race pits teams of ten or eleven on mirrored halves."
"A team wins only when every member reaches the end, within a twenty-minute cutoff."
"Each finisher lets teammates take one hostile action: a talent use, obstacle change or attack."
"Outdoors only harmless interference is allowed; in the gym, lethal attacks are allowed."
"Injuries are simulated by movement restriction; the dead restart, and teammates may not be killed."
"The course has track hurdles, a flame container, heavy weights, a fifteen-meter wall and a tank."
"Shapers get elemental weights, and may aim an element across with a single directing gesture."
"Televised one-on-one runs between famous Avowed are more popular than university team events."
